      "content": "breathing is okay i guess but it doesn't stop the actual physical sensation, like the energy just wants to get out. it's like my internal frequency is just too high for the room. i've been reading about how some people have this kind of bio-electric field that reacts to their mood. if this really is some kind of energy leakage, are there any specific techniques to help stabilize my aura or something? i just want to be able to keep my energy contained so i don't keep blowing out the lights.",
